  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "芽甘蓝",
      "anchor": "brussels_sprouts",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -6°C - 22°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 45 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 80 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 30 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 40$()$(br2)芽甘蓝是单格作物。茎上结满小球，耐寒，冬前采收最甜。$(br2)芽甘蓝种子可以种植在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，成熟后收割可以得到$(thing)芽甘蓝$()和$(thing)芽甘蓝种子$()。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "韭菜",
      "anchor": "chive",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -10°C - 26°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 40 - 80 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 可采摘蔬菜$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 60 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): +20 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): +20$()$(br2)韭菜是$(thing)可采摘蔬菜$()。气味辛香，割下叶子后很快又长齐。$(br2)种子播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，生长后期空手右键采摘可保留植株；左键破坏会拔除植株。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "荸荠",
      "anchor": "water_chestnut",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 14°C - 34°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 60 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 40 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 30 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 60$()$(br2)荸荠是单格作物。球茎脆甜，生吃炒菜都行。$(br2)先开垦$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()，再在上方备好一格深淡水水源，最后对水下农田播种。完全成熟后破坏收获食材和种子。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "菱角",
      "anchor": "water_caltrop",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 15°C - 35°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 70 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 35 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 30 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 55$()$(br2)菱角是单格作物。两角尖尖的坚果，煮粉了最好吃。$(br2)先开垦$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()，再在上方备好一格深淡水水源，最后对水下农田播种。完全成熟后破坏收获食材和种子。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "水芹",
      "anchor": "water_dropwort",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 5°C - 25°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 70 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 50 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 30 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 40$()$(br2)水芹是单格作物。水边丛生的香芹，越冷越嫩。$(br2)先开垦$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()，再在上方备好一格深淡水水源，最后对水下农田播种。完全成熟后破坏收获食材和种子。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "空心菜",
      "anchor": "water_spinach",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 18°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 65 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 80 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): +20 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): +20$()$(br2)空心菜是单格作物。茎中空的速生叶菜，割了又发。$(br2)先开垦$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()，再在上方备好一格深淡水水源，最后对水下农田播种。完全成熟后破坏收获食材和种子。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "木耳菜",
      "anchor": "malabar_spinach",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 18°C - 38°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 45 - 90 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 70 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): +20 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): +20$()$(br2)木耳菜是$(thing)攀爬性作物$()。叶片肥厚发黏，越热越旺。$(br2)种子播在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，上方留空，用木棍右键下半株搭架才能继续长高。完全成熟后破坏任意半株收获并返种、返棍，各结算一次；空手右键不采摘。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "zh_cn",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "莼菜",
      "anchor": "water_shield",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): 10°C - 30°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 80 - 100 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 40 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 20 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 30$()$(br2)莼菜是单格作物。裹着透明胶质的嫩叶，最娇气。$(br2)先开垦$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()，再在上方备好一格深淡水水源，最后对水下农田播种。完全成熟后破坏收获食材和种子。$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Brussels Sprouts",
      "anchor": "brussels_sprouts",
      "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): -6°C - 22°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 45 - 85 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 80 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 30 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 40$()$(br2)Brussels Sprouts is a single block crop: little cabbages along a tall stem.$(br2)Brussels Sprouts seeds can be planted on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$(), and once ripe the harvest gives $(thing)Brussels Sprouts$() and $(thing)Brussels Sprouts Seeds$().$(br2)"
    }
  },
  {
    "Language": "en_us",
    "Page": {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "title": "Chive",
      "anchor": "chive",
